Syntax: dfold
Syntax: dfold home
Syntax: dfold <person>

Dimensional fold is the pinnacle of psionic achievement, allowing the
practitioner to tear a temporary rift through space itself. By focusing
intensely on a destination, the psionicist creates a two-way portal
connecting their current location to the target location.

When used without an argument or with 'home', the power creates a portal
to the psionicist's hometown or default recall point. When a person's
name is specified, it creates a portal to that person's current location.

The portal manifests as a darkly pulsating bluish-purple rift in reality.
Anyone may step through the portal to travel instantly between the two
locations. The fold is bidirectional - a matching portal appears at the
destination, allowing travel in either direction.

The portals are unstable and short-lived, typically allowing only a
single passage before collapsing. Those who wish to use a dimensional
fold must act quickly.

Certain locations resist this power. Private rooms, areas that must be
physically walked to, and disabled zones cannot be reached through
dimensional folding. Immortals cannot be targeted - their minds are
too powerful to serve as a focus for the fold.

This is an advanced power requiring significant mastery and substantial
mana. It cannot be used while focusing your mind, nor by charmed beings.

See Also: PSIONICS, MIND FOCUS, PORTAL

